OL,3,AAI gold rush draws crypto firms away
OL,4,Afrom Bitcoin
OL,5,
OL,6,FCompanies that once filled warehouses
OL,7,Fwith computers to earn Bitcoin - a
OL,8,Fprocess known as mining - are now using
OL,9,Fthat computing power for AI.
OL,11,FBitcoin mining companies invested large
OL,12,Fsums on giant banks of powerful
OL,13,Fcomputers as the price of Bitcoin
OL,14,Frocketed in recent years.
OL,16,FBut those mining companies have faced
OL,17,Ffalling rewards since the value of the
OL,18,Fcryptocurrency has slumped from its
OL,19,Fpeak in October 2025.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
